WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.996
Welcome to Module 5, the last
module of Defender X D R

2
00:00:03.996 --> 00:00:09.163
Engineering and Operations:
automation, operations and evidence.

3
00:00:09.163 --> 00:00:12.100
Automation is where speed and outage meet.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.754
The same setting that contains a
compromised laptop in minutes can

5
00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:19.538
lock out the account the security
operations center needs to respond.

6
00:00:19.538 --> 00:00:24.071
In this module you set Defender's automation
to the program's response ladder,

7
00:00:24.071 --> 00:00:27.400
and exclude what must never
be contained automatically.

8
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.486
Then you run the platform: the
cadence, the monthly evidence run,

9
00:00:31.486 --> 00:00:35.100
the synthetic events, and the
metrics an assessor reads.

10
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:40.337
The module covers Steps 9 and 10 of the
Defender X D R implementation guide.

11
00:00:40.337 --> 00:00:44.540
It takes about forty minutes, plus
Lab 2 in your own test tenant.
